    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Unleash Chaotic Magic in Your Rage</p></blockquote><p>Many places in the multiverse abound with beauty, intense emotion, and rampant magic; the Feywild, the Upper Planes, and other realms of supernatural power radiate such forces and can profoundly influence people. As folk of deep feeling, Barbarians are especially susceptible to these wild influences, and some are transformed by the magic. These magic-suffused Barbarians walk the Path of Wild Magic.</p><p><em>Subclass of Tasha's Cauldron of Everything, adapted to the 2024 rules by Owidyn.</em></p><h3>Path of Wild Magic Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.jaSNv4uoPWHmpHQ8]{Magic Awareness}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.Tx738VuzMuf4bhR2]{Wild Surge}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.zQBfEq4Q3d9pLa1r]{Bolstering Magic}</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.GDBGJNQO6dJ1UZ8y]{Unstable Backlash}</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.7MHEBhbuz4sIgxr1]{Controlled Surge}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
      "chat": ""
